value "inhomogeneous" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-338023/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "a16a0680-04e8-502a-92fe-24bfd04ab5c0" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-338023/field-3/668dba9073658905cfbd208ef398f5d3f3cf0216b5f756007174dd24f51b21a9" :answer-field/choices ["q-338023/field-3/0dccd1c0d01f1a6108a63b9727608bbe91e40a553b6f3a4aeaca05919f28c3b7" "q-338023/field-3/668dba9073658905cfbd208ef398f5d3f3cf0216b5f756007174dd24f51b21a9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-338023" :question/id #uuid "0dc4a39a-133c-5d88-913a-6b2fafc59819" :question/math-academy-id "q-338023" :question/problem "Determine which of the following second-order ODEs are homogeneous, and which are inhomogeneous.$\\,$ The equation $\\,{y}^{″}-2{y}^{′}+y=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x)$ is {{field-1}}. \n\n$\\,$ The equation $\\,(1+{x}^{2}){y}^{″}+x{y}^{′}+y=0$ is {{field-2}}. \n\n$\\,$ The equation $\\,{y}^{″}+xy-{e}^{x}=0$ is {{field-3}}." :question/worked-solution "Suppose we have a second-order linear ODE given in the form\n\n$$\na(x){y}^{″}+b(x){y}^{′}+c(x)y=f(x).\n$$\n\nThe equation is homogeneous if $f(x)=0$ for all $x.$ If it is not homogeneous, then it is inhomogeneous.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine each option.\n\n- The equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}-2{y}^{′}+y=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x)\n$$\n\nis $\\text{inhomogeneous}$ since, for the right-hand side, we have $f(x)=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x),$ which is different from zero.\n\n- The equation\n\n$$\n(1+{x}^{2}){y}^{″}+x{y}^{′}+y=0\n$$\n\nis $\\text{homogeneous}$ since, for the right-hand side, we have $f(x)=0$ for all $x.$\n\n- Writing the equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+xy-{e}^{x}=0\n$$\n\nin the form $a{y}^{″}+b{y}^{′}+cy=f,$ we have\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+xy={e}^{x}.\n$$\n\nThis equation is $\\text{inhomogeneous}$ since, for the right-hand side, we have $f(x)={e}^{x},$ which is different from zero." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-338023/field-1" "q-338023/field-2" "q-338023/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "90930e15-0827-5e0b-82cf-98263fc756d6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-338023"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-338082/field-1/668dba9073658905cfbd208ef398f5d3f3cf0216b5f756007174dd24f51b21a9" :answer/id #uuid "08e081dd-2352-56a7-af9a-2486cdb77e16" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "inhomogeneous" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-338082/field-1/0dccd1c0d01f1a6108a63b9727608bbe91e40a553b6f3a4aeaca05919f28c3b7" :answer/id #uuid "c052085f-57d9-5b57-a536-9b5045df25de" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "homogeneous" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-338082/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "eb792e9f-5a42-5809-8b49-600b3cb18c2d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-338082/field-1/668dba9073658905cfbd208ef398f5d3f3cf0216b5f756007174dd24f51b21a9" :answer-field/choices ["q-338082/field-1/668dba9073658905cfbd208ef398f5d3f3cf0216b5f756007174dd24f51b21a9" "q-338082/field-1/0dccd1c0d01f1a6108a63b9727608bbe91e40a553b6f3a4aeaca05919f28c3b7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-338082/field-2/668dba9073658905cfbd208ef398f5d3f3cf0216b5f756007174dd24f51b21a9" :answer/id #uuid "ed367e1c-43a9-5c5b-8b48-814242043534" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "inhomogeneous" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-338082/field-2/0dccd1c0d01f1a6108a63b9727608bbe91e40a553b6f3a4aeaca05919f28c3b7" :answer/id #uuid "eda99050-4f18-54d3-82a9-5abe1e5067b8" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "homogeneous" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-338082/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "a8b314b8-fdf8-5685-8586-31146cc111d8" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-338082/field-2/0dccd1c0d01f1a6108a63b9727608bbe91e40a553b6f3a4aeaca05919f28c3b7" :answer-field/choices ["q-338082/field-2/668d