x)=x,$ which is different from zero.\n\n- The equation\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{tan}⁡(x){y}^{″}+{y}^{′}-6y=0\n$$\n\nis $\\text{homogeneous}$ since, for the right-hand side, we have $f(x)=0$ for all $x.$\n\n- Writing the equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}-(x+2)y+5x=0\n$$\n\nin the form $a{y}^{″}+b{y}^{′}+cy=f,$ we have\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}-(x+2)y=-5x.\n$$\n\nThis equation is $\\text{inhomogeneous}$ since, for the right-hand side, we have $f(x)=-5x,$ which is different from zero." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-338082/field-1" "q-338082/field-2" "q-338082/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "90930e15-0827-5e0b-82cf-98263fc756d6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-338082"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-93779/selection/8da00ee55c037f6d1164d7ad5fbd30fde1754d6b902183edcd4a88499c0f85ef" :answer/id #uuid "f6f0183d-735a-5bc1-961c-e83597ccb177" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}^{″}-y=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-93779/selection/5496236ff065a9a874492e1af0379991f0a478bdd4940979079eada1918fbf4b" :answer/id #uuid "7493c4dc-92f1-5093-9637-e8e3cd48b560" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}^{″}-y=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-93779/selection/43cb569620263b8e3ee3783bc41a9e735a0e1946479bc41584b05bac6a4fe618" :answer/id #uuid "62ffba74-a557-5c89-b488-0e28b12db034" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}^{″}+y=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-93779/selection/835a01085d8bc590b01b8e33d8731e397628ae162ec202f40c3a69632aae0282" :answer/id #uuid "8c9cdfd5-57f6-55a9-8af4-d7e0906ab00e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}^{″}=16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-93779/selection/c02f3063763ce9745be33c5e5ab16f60dd1aa4da23112e0ebe93e9f57c77ccbe" :answer/id #uuid "bdec2677-4461-5946-b150-262643d4d4ad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}^{″}+y=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-93779/selecti