he form\n\n$$\na(x){y}^{″}+b(x){y}^{′}+c(x)y=f(x).\n$$\n\nThe associated homogeneous equation is constructed by replacing $f(x)$ with zero:\n\n$$\na(x){y}^{″}+b(x){y}^{′}+c(x)y=0\n$$\n\nTherefore, in our case, the associated homogeneous equation is\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}{y}^{″}-5x{y}^{′}+8y=0.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-130991/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "66ec8603-ae96-5212-88e1-4571d7face6b"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130991"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130990/selection/742b166e5dbc9d9e53bdb9ac2a681199f1375162a2d19d16f8294e7cc1911134" :answer/id #uuid "e3dc1170-59a6-5448-9d15-23b38be7d712" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}^{″}-3{y}^{′}+xy=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130990/selection/5879f3c6e0ccc40fd412630581718dbe7ce5dc8e824d85a951fd90698b8b1b13" :answer/id #uuid "c0e4a815-12a7-5e90-8b07-ce78cbefe34b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}^{″}-3{y}^{′}-2{e}^{2x}y=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130990/selection/fe16cef6be651afa6ba7378ba6a90d68715e94047a03970f7eff7231071508a8" :answer/id #uuid "0faf2c69-c122-53c2-95b6-d0338851df8d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}^{″}-3{y}^{′}+y=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130990/selection/d0995e2f1e0f044fe9c41086ccac6f5502e3cb15aeff21049b1dc04b3531a645" :answer/id #uuid "8ad5ce83-f2f0-5bba-be6e-7e56300e9c5d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{-2x}{y}^{″}-3{e}^{-2x}+y=2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130990/selection/c800bb6b0a86674a16a8133a99336fb453d7ed5654b43a5f5c7deab519f15bc4" :answer/id #uuid "dec0aff9-77d5-55ac-8ef7-57de5543f9a7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{x}{y}^{″}-\\frac{3}{x}y+y=\\frac{2{e}^{2x}}{x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130990/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "192de820-9c9a-502b-b0d7-7b5d93dc7105" :answer-field/key "selection" :an