nitial value problem**.\n\nLet's go through each equation in turn.\n\n- The first system is not an initial value problem. It contains an equation only. No conditions are specified.\n\n- The second system is an initial value problem. The differential equation is together with two conditions at the same location in the domain of $y(x)$ (i.e., at $x=2$).\n\n- The third system is not an initial value problem. It consists of a differential equation together with two conditions at different points in the domain of $y(x)$ (i.e., at $x=1$ and $x=5$). This is a **boundary value problem.**" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-339253/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2d0a7ede-b896-56c6-9b60-a6aec8eff9e8"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-339253"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-339251/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer/id #uuid "b2a73aea-b259-5b50-b001-b97fdf398653" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-339251/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "aaf3f780-7239-597b-8314-7cff393c9227" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-339251/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" :answer/id #uuid "757e6245-31da-5dee-849d-87197bbd53e0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-339251/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" :answer/id #uuid "21cd639a-6016-5148-85cd-597f84de37a8" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-339251/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "81568e55-c63e-53fb-98ec-49385e1a62d8" :answer/type :